      "text": "Cut shrimp into 2 or 3 pieces and place in a large bowl. Add avocados, red and yellow tomatoes, bell pepper, green onion, cilantro, and lime juice; mix until well combined. Season with salt and pepper. Refrigerate for at least 15 minutes before serving.",
